    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... are honoured to offer a spacious luxurious apartment that spans a generous 76 m² / 818 ft²  and is located on the 4th floor with panoramic views of the grounds and surrounding area. This dream apartment is a superbly appointed 2-bedroom 2-bathroom apartment that is sure to appeal to all those who cross its threshold. Enjoying a desirable west facing aspect, the property offers well-proportioned accommodation and excellent. This is undoubtedly one of the most wonderfully presented apartment to come to the market this year in this established and idealy located development. \r\n\r\nExtending to approx. 76 m² / 818 ft²  the accommodation comprises of an inviting hallway with two double bedrooms, one ensuite master bedroom, a large family bathroom and another storage press all located off the main entrance hall. The hall flows onto a generous living/dining room area which is open plan in design, and flooded with natural light throughout the day. The newly kitchen area is discreetly located in the corner, with all modern appliances intergrated. With a flowing open plan scheme, there is a great feeling of space throughout this corner apartment and we are confident this  will tick all the boxes on the property search list.  The property is presented to the market in walk-in condition and boasts many attractive features including double glazed uPVC windows, bright spacious accommodation, numerous car space in the underground car park and a well managed development located on Drumcondra's doorstep.\r\n\r\nNo.416 provides the modern living solution for the city based professional who is seeking a property close to Dublin City Centre and within walking distance of a fine array of taverns, eateries and a selection of convenience stores. The convenience of the location cannot be overstated having every conceivable amenity within walking distance. \r\n\r\nLocated within walking distance of the City Centre and convenient to the numerous shops, cafes, bars and restaurants Drumcondra and Fairview Villages has to offer. Easy access is enjoyed to the IFSC, East Point Business Park, Dublin Airport, Beaumont, Mater & Temple Street Hospitals, DCU and Trinity and the M1 & M50 motorways. The area is very well serviced by a great public transport system. The green open spaces nearby and its close proximity to the city make it an unique location. You can walk to Drumcondra Station to use the Arrow rail service and there are also numerous bus routes servicing Drumcondra, including a Quality Bus Corridor (QBC).\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is essential to appreciate all this wonderful apartment has to offer and by appointment with MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS - 01 8844690"
      },
